[I] Install and run Python applicatoins in isolated environments

[T] pipx installs and runs end-user Python command line applications, each
[T] in its own isolated virtual environment, and makes their commands
[T] available on the PATH. It can also run an application temporarily
[T] without installing it, similar to npx.

[U] https://pipx.pypa.io

[A] Pipx Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
